---
import WorkLayout from '../../../layouts/WorkLayout.astro';
import AdSlot from '../../../components/main/AdSlot.astro';
---
<WorkLayout title="How we evaluate courses | SSEGU Work" description="Our evidence standards for course access, credentials and employability guidance.">
  <main class="work-page-shell work-evaluation-page">
    <div class="work-page-intro">
      <p class="work-eyebrow">About this catalogue</p>
      <h1>How we evaluate courses</h1>
      <p>We distinguish provider facts, dated job-market evidence and editorial assessment. A working link alone does not verify a course or its career value.</p>
    </div>
    <AdSlot placement="section" format="horizontal" minHeight={90} />
    <article class="work-detail-body work-evaluation-copy">
      <h2>Evidence labels</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Verified:</strong> directly checked against an authoritative source.</li>
        <li><strong>Supported:</strong> backed by multiple relevant sources or dated job postings.</li>
        <li><strong>Editorial assessment:</strong> our reasoned interpretation, separated from provider claims.</li>
        <li><strong>Not verified:</strong> unknown or unchecked; never presented as fact.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Access and credentials</h2>
      <p>Learning access, graded assessment, certificates, digital badges and professional exams are separate. Prices and regional availability are dated and checked with the provider; Uganda checkout details are not assumed from US pricing.</p>
    </article>
    <AdSlot placement="section" format="horizontal" minHeight={90} />
    <article class="work-detail-body work-evaluation-copy">
      <h2>Employability</h2>
      <p>Course completion does not guarantee a job, salary, promotion or freelance income. Profiles should describe plausible uses, additional skill gaps and practical evidence a learner can build.</p>
      <p>Editorial research is tracked internally by course, including its evidence completeness, last verification date and remaining work.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</WorkLayout>

<style>
  .work-evaluation-page { max-width: 1100px; }
  .work-evaluation-copy { margin-inline: auto; }
</style>
